The [I5]pthread_cond_clockwait[/I5](), [I6]pthread_cond_timedwait[/I6](), and [I7]pthread_cond_wait[/I7]() functions shall block on a
condition variable. The application shall ensure that these functions are called with [I8]mutex[/I8] locked by the calling thread;
otherwise, an error (for PTHREAD_MUTEX_ERRORCHECK and robust mutexes) or undefined behavior (for other mutexes) results.
